# Blockscout Merits — private keys (optional)
#
# One private key per line. Used only for `python3 claim.py --login`.
# After login succeeds, this file can be emptied — the JWT in tokens.json
# carries auth for ~365 days.
#
# ⚠️  DO NOT COMMIT THIS FILE. It is already in .gitignore.
# ⚠️  If this is your main wallet, prefer login_interactive.py instead —
#     it never writes the key to disk.
#
# 0xabc123...
